# Testing

Feature workflow (from `DEVELOPMENT_RULES.md`): inspect → read docs → plan (DB/API/security) → implement → **add tests** → lint → typecheck → test → build → fix → report.

- Never ignore failing tests
- Prefer provider fakes/mocks in unit tests; sandbox adapters for integration
- Cover tenancy negatives (cross-org access denied) and authZ on protected APIs
- Cover idempotency for webhooks/payments where implemented
- After changes: `pnpm lint`, `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm test`, `pnpm build` (scoped filters OK when safe)
